B.avV=new A.jU("Pride and Prejudice: plates by Hugh Thomson (George Allen, 1894) and C. E. Brock (Macmillan, 1895). Frankenstein: frontispiece and title-page vignette by Theodor von Holst, engraved by W. Chevalier (Colburn & Bentley, 1831). All are public domain; scans from Wikimedia Commons. Full per-plate sources are listed in the app\u2019s attribution file.",null)
B.avW=new A.jU("Definitions come from Webster\u2019s Revised Unabridged Dictionary (G. & C. Merriam Co., 1913), a public-domain work, via the Project Gutenberg text (gutenberg.org/ebooks/29765) as parsed by the WebstersEnglishDictionary project on GitHub. Definitions are shortened to their first senses; being from 1913, they reflect the usage and attitudes of their time.",null)
B.avX=new A.jU("All books come from Standard Ebooks (standardebooks.org), a volunteer project that produces carefully proofread, beautifully formatted editions of public-domain works.",null)
